 "b05_0117": {
  "en": "episode(tag=meme_Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw)  ->Aren't those Xenohuman? It's funnier than the dismal penguins being human. \\n\\n... \\n\\nThe interstellar feudal empire of foxes blessed by the stars. The foxes go on a relentless expedition to repay the favor...",
  "ctx": "MemeDefs / Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw",
  "field": "descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.0",
  "n": 1
 },
 "b05_0118": {
  "en": "episode(tag=meme_Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw)  ->Hardware is human, software is a complete fox. \\n\\n... \\n\\nThe interstellar feudal empire of foxes blessed by the stars. The foxes go on a relentless expedition to repay the favor...",
  "ctx": "MemeDefs / Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw",
  "field": "descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2",
  "n": 1
 },
 "b05_0119": {
  "en": "episode(tag=meme_Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw)  ->I think it's better to make humans as pets. I-It's not about revenge! It's just that you're cute.\\n\\n...\\n\\nThe interstellar feudal empire of foxes blessed by the star, the Mihos embark on an endless exploration to repay the grace...",
  "ctx": "MemeDef / Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw",
  "field": "descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1",
  "n": 1
 },
 "b05_0120": {
  "en": "episode(tag=meme_Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw)  ->I'd better get rid of humans as pets. It's not really the realm of revenge! It's just that you guys are so cute. \\n\\n... \\n\\nThe interstellar feudal empire of foxes blessed by the stars. The foxes go on a relentless expedition to repay the favor...",
  "ctx": "MemeDefs / Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw",
  "field": "descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.1",
  "n": 1
 },
 "b05_0121": {
  "en": "episode(tag=meme_Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw)  ->Their hardware is human, but the software is completely fox.\\n\\n...\\n\\nThe interstellar feudal empire of foxes blessed by the star, the Mihos embark on an endless exploration to repay the grace...",
  "ctx": "MemeDef / Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw",
  "field": "descriptionMaker.rules.rulesStrings.2",
  "n": 1
 },
 "b05_0122": {
  "en": "episode(tag=meme_Miho_MihoicCodeofLaw)  ->Those bitchs aren't xenohumans? That's even worse to saying those filthy penguins are actually humans.\\n\\n...\\n\\nThe interstellar feudal empire of foxes blessed by the star, the Mihos embark on an endless exploration to repay the grace...",
